msgid "Arthur Nieuwland"
msgstr "Arthur Nieuwland"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:34
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Blackbody is a viewer for FLIR and Fluke thermograms and other thermal "
"images. Explore temperatures under the cursor, render to different palettes "
"and ranges, overlay the visible-light photo, and inspect embedded "
"measurements and camera metadata."
msgstr ""
"Blackbody est un visionneur de thermogrammes FLIR et d’autres images "
"thermiques. Explorez les températures sous le curseur, effectuez le rendu "
"avec différentes palettes et plages, superposez la photo en lumière visible "
"et examinez les mesures intégrées et les métadonnées de la caméra."

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:35
msgid ""
"Blackbody reads thermograms from many FLIR cameras, including the visible-"
"light photo, and also opens Fluke thermograms from cameras such as the "
"Ti400, Ti401p, TiS75+, and Ti25. Plain thermal data can be imported and "
"exported as single-band TIFFs or 16-bit PNGs."
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:36
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Fonctionnalités :"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Inspect the temperature under the cursor, in celsius, fahrenheit, or kelvin"
msgstr ""
"Les températures peuvent être affichées en Celsius, Fahrenheit ou Kelvin"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:39
#, fuzzy
msgid "View embedded measurements: spots, lines, and areas"
msgstr "Affichage des mesures intégrées : points, lignes et zones"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:40
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Overlay view (Picture-in-Picture or MSX) combining thermal and visible images"
msgstr ""
"Vue en superposition, aussi appelée image dans l’image ou MSX, combinant les "
"images thermique et visible"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:41
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Render to the camera's embedded palette or many built-in ones, including "
"inferno and turbo"
msgstr ""
"Rendu avec de nombreuses palettes de couleurs différentes, dont inferno et "
"turbo"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:42
msgid "Adjust the temperature range to make details stand out"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:43
msgid "Metadata panel with camera info and GPS location, openable in a map"
msgstr ""
"Panneau de métadonnées avec les informations de la caméra et la position "
"GPS, affichable sur une carte"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:44
#, fuzzy
msgid "Export renders to PNG and thermal data to TIFF or 16-bit PNG"
msgstr ""
"Exporter les rendus en PNG et les données thermiques en TIFF ou PNG 16 bits "
"en centikelvin"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:45
msgid "Zoom, pan, and browse through a folder of thermograms"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:46
#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:141
msgid "Translated to multiple languages"
msgstr "Traduit en plusieurs langues"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:53
msgid ""
"Blackbody now opens Fluke thermograms! This release adds support for is2 "
"files, both older binary and newer zip-style, from cameras such as the "
"Ti400, Ti401p, TiS75+, and Ti25 — including the visible-light photo, "
"embedded measurements, capture parameters, and the camera's palette. Other "
"improvements:"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:55
msgid ""
"FLIR (and Fluke!) thermograms open in the render range embedded by the camera"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:56
msgid "A more natural double-ended temperature range slider"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:57
msgid ""
"The info panel is available for all file formats, and panels recover "
"gracefully when a file fails to load"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:58
msgid ""
"Blackbody can now open files from a file manager's \"Open with\" menu for "
"JPEG, PNG, and TIFF files, including from within the Flatpak sandbox"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:59
msgid "Improved keywords and categories make Blackbody easier to find"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:66
msgid ""
"An incremental release improving how you browse and navigate thermograms:"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:68
msgid ""
"Added \"Open folder…\" (Ctrl+Shift+O) to browse a whole directory with the "
"keyboard, working within the Flatpak sandbox via the file chooser portal"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:69
msgid ""
"Reduced Flatpak permissions: file access is now granted per file/folder via "
"the portal instead of static filesystem access"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:70
msgid ""
"On-screen previous/next arrows appear when the directory has more "
"thermograms to browse through"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:71
msgid ""
"Pressing a navigation key when only the open file is accessible shows a hint "
"with a shortcut to open the folder instead"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:72
msgid "The image can be dragged to pan when it is larger than the window"
msgstr ""

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:79
msgid ""
"A major release porting Blackbody to GTK4 and libadwaita, with a redesigned "
"interface and many new features:"
msgstr ""
"Une version majeure portant Blackbody vers GTK4 et libadwaita, avec une "
"interface repensée et de nombreuses nouvelles fonctionnalités :"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:81
msgid ""
"Completely redesigned user interface, dark by default, with on-screen "
"temperature range sliders"
msgstr ""
"Interface utilisateur entièrement repensée, sombre par défaut, avec des "
"curseurs de plage de température à l’écran"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:82
msgid ""
"Overlay view (Picture-in-Picture or MSX) next to the thermal and visible "
"spectrum views"
msgstr ""
"Vue en superposition (image dans l’image ou MSX) en plus des vues thermique "
"et en spectre visible"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:83
msgid ""
"Embedded measurements (spots, lines, and areas) are now drawn on the render"
msgstr ""
"Les mesures intégrées (points, lignes et zones) sont désormais dessinées sur "
"le rendu"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:84
msgid "Temperatures can be shown in celsius, fahrenheit, or kelvin"
msgstr ""
"Les températures peuvent être affichées en Celsius, Fahrenheit ou Kelvin"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:85
msgid ""
"Information panel showing camera metadata and GPS location, with the option "
"to open the location in a map"
msgstr ""
"Panneau d’informations affichant les métadonnées de la caméra et la position "
"GPS, avec la possibilité d’ouvrir la position sur une carte"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:86
msgid "Support for loading 16-bit centikelvin PNGs"
msgstr "Prise en charge du chargement des PNG 16 bits en centikelvin"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:87
msgid ""
"Scroll to zoom and keyboard navigation through all thermograms in a directory"
msgstr ""
"Zoom à la molette et navigation au clavier parmi tous les thermogrammes d’un "
"répertoire"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:88
msgid "Palette choice is remembered when opening the next thermogram"
msgstr "Le choix de palette est mémorisé à l’ouverture du thermogramme suivant"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:89
msgid "Improved export options and clearer error messages"
msgstr "Options d’exportation améliorées et messages d’erreur plus clairs"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:90
msgid "More supported FLIR cameras due to upgrading to flyr==0.7.0"
msgstr ""
"Davantage de caméras FLIR prises en charge grâce à la mise à jour vers "
"flyr==0.7.0"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:97
msgid "This release overhauls the UI and adds important new features:"
msgstr ""
"Cette version remanie l’interface et ajoute d’importantes nouvelles "
"fonctionnalités :"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:99
msgid "Ability to view visual images (photos) in FLIR images"
msgstr "Possibilité d’afficher les images optiques (photos) des images FLIR"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:100
msgid "Support for rendering thermal data to FLIR's embedded palettes"
msgstr ""
"Prise en charge du rendu des données thermiques avec les palettes intégrées "
"de FLIR"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:101
msgid ""
"Correcting for the rotation of a thermogram to show the image right side up"
msgstr ""
"Correction de la rotation d’un thermogramme pour afficher l’image dans le "
"bon sens"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:108
msgid "This release adds major interactivity improvements:"
msgstr "Cette version apporte d’importantes améliorations d’interactivité :"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:110
msgid "Temperature in the render can be investigated by hovering over pixels"
msgstr ""
"La température dans le rendu peut être examinée en survolant les pixels"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:111
msgid "Added a thermometer showing the colors and associated temperatures"
msgstr ""
"Ajout d’un thermomètre montrant les couleurs et les températures associées"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:112
msgid "Thermogram renders can be saved to PNGs"
msgstr "Les rendus de thermogrammes peuvent être enregistrés en PNG"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:113
msgid "Thermograms' celsius data can be exported to tiff"
msgstr ""
"Les données en Celsius des thermogrammes peuvent être exportées en TIFF"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:114
msgid ""
"Allowed temperature range is now -273,15 to 1.000.000 instead of -99 to 99 "
"(all °C)"
msgstr ""
"La plage de température autorisée va désormais de -273,15 à 1 000 000 au "
"lieu de -99 à 99 (le tout en °C)"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:121
msgid "A small, incremental update to Blackbody. Improvements:"
msgstr "Une petite mise à jour incrémentale de Blackbody. Améliorations :"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:123
msgid "An error message is shown if opening a thermogram fails"
msgstr "Un message d’erreur s’affiche si l’ouverture d’un thermogramme échoue"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:124
msgid ""
"When opening fails, Blackbody doesn't unload any loaded thermograms anymore"
msgstr ""
"En cas d’échec de l’ouverture, Blackbody ne décharge plus les thermogrammes "
"déjà chargés"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:125
msgid ""
"Added logo's heat waves as a nicer placeholder when no thermogram is opened "
"yet"
msgstr ""
"Ajout des ondes de chaleur du logo comme espace réservé plus agréable quand "
"aucun thermogramme n’est encore ouvert"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:126
msgid ""
"Refined headerbar controls to only be sensitive when a thermogram is opened"
msgstr ""
"Les contrôles de la barre d’en-tête ne sont désormais actifs que lorsqu’un "
"thermogramme est ouvert"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:127
msgid ""
"Three more known-to-be-compatible cameras (FLIR C2, FLIR E5 and FLIR P60)"
msgstr ""
"Trois caméras de plus reconnues comme compatibles (FLIR C2, FLIR E5 et FLIR "
"P60)"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:134
msgid "First release of Blackbody. The most important features are:"
msgstr ""
"Première version de Blackbody. Les fonctionnalités les plus importantes "
"sont :"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:136
msgid "Loading FLIR thermograms from many cameras"
msgstr "Chargement de thermogrammes FLIR depuis de nombreuses caméras"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:137
msgid "Loading single-band TIFFs assumed to be in °C"
msgstr "Chargement de TIFF monobande supposés être en °C"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:138
msgid "Rendering to many different color palettes, including inferno and turbo"
msgstr ""
"Rendu avec de nombreuses palettes de couleurs différentes, dont inferno et "
"turbo"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:139
msgid "Specifying the thermal range to render"
msgstr "Spécifier la plage de température à afficher"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:140
msgid "Zooming in and out"
msgstr "Zoom avant et arrière"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:142
msgid "Available for Linux and Windows"
msgstr "Disponible pour Linux et Windows"

#: data/eu.nimmerfort.blackbody.metainfo.xml.in:150
msgid "Inspect thermograms rendered with the palette embedded by the camera"
